# Upload filter for `railway up`. Railway's CLI does NOT read .gitignore or
# .dockerignore, so the local .venv/ (272 MB) would otherwise be swept into
# the build context and blow the ~200 MB upload limit (Cloudflare 413).
# Keep this in sync with .dockerignore.
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
*.egg-info
.env
.env.*
tests/
